      "summaries": {
        "en": "AiToEarn is an open-source Electron app that automates content publishing to Chinese social platforms like Douyin, Kuaishou, and Xiaohongshu. It uses AI to generate or optimize posts, saving creators time on repetitive tasks. Technically, it combines a React frontend with platform-specific APIs for seamless auto-publishing. You can extend it by adding new platform adapters or integrating custom AI models for content creation. Ideal for social media managers or indie creators looking to scale their output efficiently.",
        "zh": "AiToEarn 是一个开源 Electron 桌面应用，旨在通过 AI 自动发布内容到抖音、快手、小红书等中文社交平台，解决创作者在多平台重复发布内容的痛点。其技术亮点在于使用 React 构建前端界面，并通过封装各平台 API 实现一键自动发布，同时预留了 AI 内容生成接口，可集成大模型优化文案或生成素材。你可以通过添加新的平台适配器来扩展支持范围，或接入自定义 AI 模型实现个性化内容创作。适合需要高效管理多账号、提升内容分发效率的社交媒体运营者或独立创作者。",
        "es": "AiToEarn is an open-source Electron app that automates content publishing to Chinese social platforms like Douyin, Kuaishou, and Xiaohongshu. It uses AI to generate or optimize posts, saving creators time on repetitive tasks. Technically, it combines a React frontend with platform-specific APIs for seamless auto-publishing. You can extend it by adding new platform adapters or integrating custom AI models for content creation. Ideal for social media managers or indie creators looking to scale their output efficiently.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "AiToEarn stands out for auto-publish, douyin, and douyin-api in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "AiToEarn is an open-source Electron app that automates content publishing to Chinese social platforms like Douyin, Kuaishou, and Xiaohongshu. It uses AI to generate or optimize posts, saving creators time on repetitive tasks. Technically, it combines a React frontend with platform-specific APIs for seamless auto-publishing. You can extend it by adding new platform adapters or integrating custom AI models for content creation. Ideal for social media managers or indie creators looking to scale their output efficiently.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/yikart/AiToEarn for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
