      "summaries": {
        "en": "react-doctor is a tool that catches bad React code written by AI agents or humans, solving the problem of low-quality generated components. It uses static analysis and rule-based checks to identify anti-patterns like missing keys, inefficient re-renders, or incorrect hooks usage. You can integrate it into your CI/CD pipeline or run it locally to review AI-generated React code before merging, ensuring production-ready quality.",
        "zh": "react-doctor 是一个专门检测 React 代码问题的工具，尤其擅长捕捉 AI 代理或开发者编写的低质量组件。它通过静态分析和规则检查，识别常见反模式，如缺失 key、无效重渲染或 Hook 使用错误。你可以将其集成到 CI/CD 流程中，或在本地运行，在合并前审查 AI 生成的 React 代码，确保生产质量。这个工具的核心价值在于填补了 AI 代码审查的空白，让团队放心使用 AI 辅助开发。试试用它检查你的 AI 助手写的 React 组件吧。",
        "es": "react-doctor is a tool that catches bad React code written by AI agents or humans, solving the problem of low-quality generated components. It uses static analysis and rule-based checks to identify anti-patterns like missing keys, inefficient re-renders, or incorrect hooks usage. You can integrate it into your CI/CD pipeline or run it locally to review AI-generated React code before merging, ensuring production-ready quality.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "react-doctor stands out for agents, code-review, and doctor in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "react-doctor is a tool that catches bad React code written by AI agents or humans, solving the problem of low-quality generated components. It uses static analysis and rule-based checks to identify anti-patterns like missing keys, inefficient re-renders, or incorrect hooks usage. You can integrate it into your CI/CD pipeline or run it locally to review AI-generated React code before merging, ensuring production-ready quality.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/millionco/react-doctor for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
