      "summaries": {
        "en": "OpenHuman is a private, simple, and powerful personal AI assistant built in Rust. It prioritizes user privacy by running entirely locally, eliminating cloud dependencies. Its key strength is combining local LLM inference with tool-use capabilities for tasks like web search, file management, and code execution. Developers can extend it via plugins or integrate it into their workflows as a secure, offline AI copilot. Ideal for privacy-conscious users needing a versatile, self-hosted AI.",
        "zh": "OpenHuman 是一个用 Rust 构建的个人 AI 超级智能助手，主打隐私、简单和强大。它完全在本地运行，无需云端服务，确保数据安全。其核心优势在于将本地大模型推理与工具调用能力结合，支持网页搜索、文件管理、代码执行等操作。开发者可通过插件扩展功能，或将其集成到工作流中作为安全的离线 AI 副驾驶。适合注重隐私且需要多功能自托管 AI 的用户。",
        "es": "OpenHuman is a private, simple, and powerful personal AI assistant built in Rust. It prioritizes user privacy by running entirely locally, eliminating cloud dependencies. Its key strength is combining local LLM inference with tool-use capabilities for tasks like web search, file management, and code execution. Developers can extend it via plugins or integrate it into their workflows as a secure, offline AI copilot. Ideal for privacy-conscious users needing a versatile, self-hosted AI.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "openhuman gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "OpenHuman is a private, simple, and powerful personal AI assistant built in Rust. It prioritizes user privacy by running entirely locally, eliminating cloud dependencies. Its key strength is combining local LLM inference with tool-use capabilities for tasks like web search, file management, and code execution. Developers can extend it via plugins or integrate it into their workflows as a secure, offline AI copilot. Ideal for privacy-conscious users needing a versatile, self-hosted AI.",
